                        <span>Helps visibly calm the look of redness</span>
                        <p>Our patent-pending airless pump delivers consistent serum with every press — no clogging, no leaks, no guesswork.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span>Airless pump for consistent flow</span>
                        <p>0.5mm, 24-karat gold-plated, sterile microneedles create micro-channels so active ingredients absorb deeper and work harder.</p>
