        <article class="why-it-works__text">
            <h2>Inspired by the Clinic.<br /> Made for Home.</h2>
        </article>
        <div class="why-it-works__main">
            <div class="why-it-works__according">
                <div class="c-accordion c-accordion--lines">
                    <div class="c-accordion__list">
                        <details class="c-accordion__item" open>
                            <summary class="c-accordion__summary">
                                {{> e-icon icon="benefits-box" }}
                                No Set-Up Required
                            </summary>
                            <article class="c-accordion__content">
                                <p>Comes preassembled, with the PDRN serum and needle head sealed in one cartridge. Just remove the cap and start.</p>
                            </article>
                        </details>
                        <details class="c-accordion__item">
                            <summary class="c-accordion__summary">
                                {{> e-icon icon="double-drop" }}
                                Naturally Pink
                            </summary>
                            <article class="c-accordion__content">
                                <p>The pink is the natural color of Vitamin B12 (cyanocobalamin), not a dye. B12 also helps visibly calm the look of redness and reactive-looking skin.</p>
                            </article>
                        </details>
                        <details class="c-accordion__item">
                            <summary class="c-accordion__summary">
                                {{> e-icon icon="rotation" }}
                                Single-Use &amp; Disposable
                            </summary>
                            <article class="c-accordion__content">
                                <p>Designed for hygienic, single-use treatment. Each needle head is EO-sterilized and intended for one-time use. Made with 80% GRS-certified recycled post-consumer polycarbonate.</p>
                            </article>
                        </details>
                        <details class="c-accordion__item">
                            <summary class="c-accordion__summary">
                                {{> e-icon icon="shield" }}
                                Patent-pending design
                            </summary>
                            <article class="c-accordion__content">
                                <p>Our airless pump delivers a consistent amount of serum with every press, designed for smoother flow and less mess.</p>
                            </article>
                        </details>
                        <details class="c-accordion__item">
                            <summary class="c-accordion__summary">
                                {{> e-icon icon="needles" }}
                                24K Gold-Plated Needles
                            </summary>
                            <article class="c-accordion__content">
                                <p>0.5mm, 24 karat gold-plated stainless steel needles.</p>
                            </article>
                        </details>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
