    {{#> expert-feature }}
        <h6>Does it hurt?</h6>
        <h2>What it actually feels like: a light prickle.</h2>
        <article>
            <p>Picture Velcro pressed lightly against your skin. That’s the feeling. The 0.5mm needles stamp straight down. No rolling, no dragging, no tugging. </p>
            <p>Each stamp creates tiny channels that help your skin take up the serum, for smoother-looking, more radiant skin.</p>
            <p>Every treatment starts with a fresh, sterile, single-use needle head, so there’s nothing to worry about on the hygiene side either.</p>
        </article>
        <div class="expert-card">
            <blockquote>“What I really like about Qure Micro-Infusion is the thought put into safe at-home use. Every treatment starts with a fresh, sterile, single-use needle head. That attention to detail matters.”</blockquote>
